  {
   "id": 549296,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Suppose that States A, B, and C annex State D and increase the house size proportionately.\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li>Calculate the standard divisor based on the new house size.</li>\n<li>Use the Hamilton method to reapportion the seats.</li>\n<li>Does the new-states paradox occur?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [],
